;align-items:center;gap:4px;\">📧 Email</span><span style=\"padding:3.5px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#e0e7ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#4338ca;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\">✈ Telegram</span><span style=\"padding:3.5px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#dcfce7;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#166534;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\">💬 WhatsApp</span></div></div></div></div>"
