 style=\"padding:2.5px 8px;background:#fef9c3;border:1px solid #fde047;border-radius:4px;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#a16207;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;\"><span style=\"width:4px;height:4px;background:#a16207;border-radius:50%;\"></span>Email</span><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:600;\">#12</span></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:12px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.04);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(37,99,235,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z\"/><polyline points=\"22,6 12,13 2,6\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">OTP WhatsApp Verification</div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Subj: Verification Code - ShiFor</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:end;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:2.5px 8px;background:#dcfce7;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:4px;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#166534;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;\"><span style=\"width:4px;height:4px;background:#166534;border-radius:50%;\"></span>WhatsApp</span><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:600;\">#13</span></div></div></div></div>"
